  "question": {
    "text": "An ideal gas <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is expanded adiabatically. How many times its initial volume should the gas be expanded to reduce the root mean square velocity of molecules by a factor of&nbsp;<math><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></math>?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math > <mtext>4</mtext></math> times",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>16</mtext></mrow> </math> times",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mtext>8</mtext></math> times",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mtext>2</mtext></math> times",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi>rms</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi>or</mi><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi>rms</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi>rms</mi></msub></math> is to reduce two times, i.e.&nbsp;the temperature of the gas will have to reduce four times or<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />During the adiabatic process,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><msup><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msup><mo>⁡</mo><mo>'</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><msup><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>'</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><msup><mo>⁡</mo><mo>'</mo></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>"
  }
